# This repository compares generated files against committed ones byte for
# byte, so line endings have to be deterministic. core.autocrlf on Windows
# would check these out as CRLF while CI on Linux writes LF, which turns a
# clean tree into a --check failure that reproduces on one platform only.
* text=auto eol=lf

# index.html is the deployed artifact; never let a checkout rewrite it.
index.html -text
legacy/*.html -text
